{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The playable demo is now live!</strong> I hope you\u2019ll give it a try and let me know what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game is still in early development, there are undoubtedly rough edges and bugs to be found. I\u2019d greatly appreciate your feedback and bug reports in the Steam Community forums. Your input will help me refine the demo and shape the official release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff08The values in the official release version will differ significantly from those in this demo version.\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your support and for helping me make this game the best it can be!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combine and Position Buildings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place buildings to <strong>automatically generate</strong> gold or combat units. Maximize efficiency by leveraging <strong>synergy bonuses</strong> based on placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/2025-02-19_10-38-50.mkv_20250219_120311808.png?t=1744586393\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Automated Units and Intense Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a mighty human army by combining units with <strong>counterplay strategies</strong>. Watch your forces march into battle, overcoming enemies and destroying their core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/2025-02-19_10-54-22.mkv_20250219_115832226.png?t=1744586393\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game-Changing Commander Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from commanders with unique <strong>active skills</strong>, <strong>passive traits</strong>, and four <strong>exclusive buildings</strong> to shape your strategy and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/45edeca2-3a1e-42b0-b85e-38349165120b.png?t=1744586393\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480990?t=1744586393","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480990?t=1744586393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/a2b1e82aacdaf50a98acc8dc942e0738f5ecaf27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744586393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/a2b1e82aacdaf50a98acc8dc942e0738f5ecaf27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744586393","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3543930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The playable demo is now live!</strong> I hope you\u2019ll give it a try and let me know what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game is still in early development, there are undoubtedly rough edges and bugs to be found. I\u2019d greatly appreciate your feedback and bug reports in the Steam Community forums. Your input will help me refine the demo and shape the official release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff08The values in the official release version will differ significantly from those in this demo version.\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your support and for helping me make this game the best it can be!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combine and Position Buildings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place buildings to <strong>automatically generate</strong> gold or combat units. Maximize efficiency by leveraging <strong>synergy bonuses</strong> based on placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta